{"id":"increi_ble","lemma":"increíble","pos":"adj","rank":418,"glosses":["incredible, unbelievable"],"ipa":"/inkɾeˈible/","forms":{"femininePlural":"increíbles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-incre%C3%ADble.wav","examples":[{"text":"Increíble, ¿a que sí?","en":"Isn't that terrific?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611959"},{"text":"Fue una de las experiencias más increíbles de mi vida.","en":"It was one of the most incredible experiences of my life.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609822"},{"text":"Creo que es increíble.","en":"I think it's amazing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567715"},{"text":"Son increíbles.","en":"You're amazing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441366"},{"text":"Creo que eres increíble.","en":"I think you're amazing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461947"}]}